  "body": "## Install\n\n- **Windows 10/11**: run `ENiShare-Setup-1.1.2.exe`. The installer is not code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may show *Windows protected your PC*; click *More info → Run anyway*.\n- **Ubuntu 22.04+**: `sudo apt install ./enishare_1.1.2_amd64.deb`, or run `ENiShare-1.1.2-x86_64.AppImage`.\n\n## What's new\n\n- **New app icon** from the new EN family icon set: in the app, the app menu, the taskbar and the installer. The iPhone page and its home-screen icon have it too.\n",
